   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "En arrivant",
     "texto": [
      "**En** + present participle forms the gérondif: **En arrivant, j'ai vu Thomas** (upon arriving, I saw Thomas).",
      "It links two actions of the same subject; depending on the context it can express simultaneity, manner, or an action happening immediately before."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Same subject",
     "texto": [
      "In normal use, the one who does the gerund action is also the subject of the main clause: **En rentrant, je suis allé dormir** (coming home, I went to bed).",
      "It does not mean that both expressions name just one action."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Use",
     "columnas": [
